#: ../../manual/advanced/command_line/arguments.rst:76
msgid "Use amount of ``<threads>`` for rendering and other operations [1-1024], 0 to use the system's processor count."
msgstr "Använder ``<threads>`` trådar för rendering och andra åtgärder [1-1024]; 0 använder systemets processorantal."

#: ../../manual/advanced/command_line/arguments.rst:107
msgid "Set the render format. Valid options are: ``TGA`` ``RAWTGA`` ``JPEG`` ``IRIS`` ``PNG`` ``BMP`` ``HDR`` ``TIFF``."
msgstr "Anger renderingsformatet. Giltiga alternativ är: ``TGA`` ``RAWTGA`` ``JPEG`` ``IRIS`` ``PNG`` ``BMP`` ``HDR`` ``TIFF``."

