msgstr "``--no-window-frame``"

#: ../../manual/advanced/command_line/arguments.rst:208
msgid "Allow Python to use system environment variables such as ``PYTHONPATH``. This also enables user environment, see: ``--python-use-user-env``."
msgstr "Tillåter Python att använda systemets miljövariabler, exempelvis ``PYTHONPATH``. Detta aktiverar även användarmiljön; se även: ``--python-use-user-env``."

